{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep in the woods lies a hidden place you were never meant to find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Warning:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features heavy visual distortion and view bobbing that may trigger motion sickness in some players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take control of an urban explorer content creator upon their discovery of an abandoned underground facility. Upon entering the facility, they become locked inside. They must find items and progress deeper to eventually find their way out while avoiding the deadly monster that lurks within. Uncover the horrors within and decide whether to leave everything buried, or burn it all away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Style:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features a found footage style that embodies the recording of an amateur content creator.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i>Stealth mechanics</i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use vents, distractions, and clever tactics to avoid, lure, and escape the feral entity hunting you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i>Random item spawns</i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most items spawn semi-randomly, leading to a unique and replayable experience. Some playthroughs will be easier or more difficult than others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i>Multiple endings</i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features 3 endings, each with hidden requirements to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decrepit features a full story featuring themes of deception, corporate greed, and self sacrifice. Various audio logs and notes are hidden throughout to help you uncover the truth of what happened in this facility.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3997930?t=1772741282","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3997930?t=1772741282","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997930/16412c8392de1a46e9777b5766ea3d9ab208bce2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772741282","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997930/16412c8392de1a46e9777b5766ea3d9ab208bce2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772741282","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"dark themes featuring small amounts of gore and blood. a dark story with elements of extortion and mass amounts of death."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep in the woods lies a hidden place you were never meant to find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Warning:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features heavy visual distortion and view bobbing that may trigger motion sickness in some players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take control of an urban explorer content creator upon their discovery of an abandoned underground facility. Upon entering the facility, they become locked inside. They must find items and progress deeper to eventually find their way out while avoiding the deadly monster that lurks within. Uncover the horrors within and decide whether to leave everything buried, or burn it all away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Style:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features a found footage style that embodies the recording of an amateur content creator.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i>Stealth mechanics</i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use vents, distractions, and clever tactics to avoid, lure, and escape the feral entity hunting you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i>Random item spawns</i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most items spawn semi-randomly, leading to a unique and replayable experience. Some playthroughs will be easier or more difficult than others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i>Multiple endings</i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features 3 endings, each with hidden requirements to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decrepit features a full story featuring themes of deception, corporate greed, and self sacrifice. Various audio logs and notes are hidden throughout to help you uncover the truth of what happened in this facility.</p>","developers":["BladeworkzGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997930/6dfccccdfb3cd63507b1dd36ca11489a24e54de6/header.jpg?t=1772741282","is_free":false,"linux_re